    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Osvaldo Golijov's \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n segun San Marcos \u201d re-imagined in XR for the release of the &quot;Live at 25&quot; live recording by Gateway Chamber Orchestra and Chorale and Summit Records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a 3D point cloud theater environment, \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n XR \u201d brings visitors to an ephemeral, audio-reactive concert experience where they are free to explore a showcase of powerful volumetric and 360 stereo recordings of the Gateway Chamber Orchestra in Clarksville, TN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Spring of 2023, the ensemble performed a limited run of the landmark work by composer Osvaldo Golijov - \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n segun San Marcos \u201d (2000) and the team of technologists at Agile Lens were invited to create a cinematic experience that brings the piece to life in virtual space for all to experience. Using methods like volumetric capture and 3D scanning, the creators have made a world where anyone can get incredible seats to witness the choreography, or examine some of the unique instrumentation rarely performed outside of Latin America.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of Osvaldo Golijov's \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n segun San Marcos \u201d re-imagined in XR for the release of the &quot;Live at 25&quot; live recording by Gateway Chamber Orchestra and Chorale and Summit Records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a 3D point cloud theater environment, \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n XR \u201d brings visitors to an ephemeral, audio-reactive concert experience where they are free to explore a showcase of powerful volumetric and 360 stereo recordings of the Gateway Chamber Orchestra in Clarksville, TN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > In Spring of 2023, the ensemble performed a limited run of the landmark work by composer Osvaldo Golijov - \u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n segun San Marcos \u201d (2000) and the team of technologists at Agile Lens were invited to create a cinematic experience that brings the piece to life in virtual space for all to experience. Using methods like volumetric capture and 3D scanning, the creators have made a world where anyone can get incredible seats to witness the choreography, or examine some of the unique instrumentation rarely performed outside of Latin America.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cLa Pasi\u00f3n XR&quot; takes guests on an ephemeral, audio-reactive journey through the Gateway Chamber Orchestra\u2019s Spring 2023 performance of Osvaldo Golijov's La Pasion seg\u00fan San Marcos.",
